# Denmark 2026 Trip

I'm trying out darktable for post-processing as a change from Darkroom. It's a little temperamental but after a solid day of use I see the appeal.

=> https://www.darktable.org darktable
=> https://darkroom.co Darkroom

On my M1 it's also a lot more performant and has fewer crashes than Darkroom.

